```console
$ useful project --help
Manage Useful Machinery projects

Usage: useful project [COMMAND]

Commands:
  archive      Archive a project
  create       Create a project
  list         List projects
  rename       Rename a project
  repository   Manage a project's repository binding
  runner-pool  Manage a project's runner pools
  show         Show a project
  unarchive    Unarchive a project
  webhook      Manage a project's signed webhooks
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
